00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.430
Did you come here all by yourself, Futaba?

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:17.350
Yes.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.350
I just happened to run
into her right out front.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:24.310
I heard that all of you will
be doing your summer homework,

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:28.020
so I wanted to join you!

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.780
She's so adorable!

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:48.710
<i>I had dropped something important</i>
<i>and even though I didn't know you,</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:54.260
<i>You had found it and brought it back</i>
<i>to me unexpectedly this morning</i>

00:00:54.260 --> 00:01:00.010
<i>Oh yeah, I was always told to</i>
<i>write my name on important things</i>

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:05.770
<i>Or I might end up losing them somewhere</i>

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:08.730
<i>It's not (anyone's fault)</i>

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.440
<i>It's not (like it belongs to anyone else)</i>

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:16.650
<i>The world will always be right there</i>

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:19.370
<i>Let the wind (take you by the hand)</i>

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:22.160
<i>And the sky (now, breathe together)</i>

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.830
<i>And let's go (it's now begun to move)</i>

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:28.000
<i>The arrow in our hearts</i>

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.920
<i>If I'm (yes, if I'm with you)</i>

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:34.300
<i>With you (yes, because I'm with you)</i>

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:44.470
<i>We still don't know what's going to</i>
<i>happen in this future that's moving forward</i>

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.190
<i>And bouncing glitteringly</i>

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:05.040
